This library implements evolutionary multi- and many-objective optimization
algorithms that were originally described in the scientific literature. Each
source file names the primary publication it follows, with authors, venue and
DOI. Those publications remain the intellectual work of their respective
authors; this project claims copyright only in its own source code.

If MOOtation contributes to academic work, a citation is appreciated.
See CITATION.cff.
